{"id": "61317", "title": "圈宠又名《性奴", "author": "不详", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61317.htm", "intro": "他,一个风流成性的子弟. 有钱,有势,有形,唯一没有的是心 会笑,\r\n\r\n只是你分不出来他笑的意义: 会玩人于股掌,让人畏惧. 会让每个女人为他销魂.\r\n\r\n唯一不会的就是爱一个人. 他,是我老公,是公司之首,是老师,也是我的性主\r\n\r\n我,平凡,如世间一粒尘埃一样渺小. 心如止水,如果是一种境地. 不知也算不算无心...", "base": "files/article/html/61/61317", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "9030081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "9030082.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "9030084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "9030086.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "9030089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "9030091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "9030093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "9030099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "9030100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "9030101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "9030105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "9030107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "9030110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "9030112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "9030114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "9030116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "9030119.html", "available": false}]}